 Memorize","kind":"title1","maxW":1800},"rowC":{"x":0,"y":2300,"text":"A lesson, start to finish","kind":"title1","maxW":2270},"rowD":{"x":0,"y":3600,"text":"Mastery, Learn and kids","kind":"title1","maxW":1330},"system":{"x":1410,"y":0,"w":420,"text":"The system\n• Tabs: Today · Memorize · Learn · Family\n• Behind every screen: a real photo that drifts slowly and follows the time of day (dawn, day, dusk, night)\n• In front: frosted glass cards. Light glass by day, dark glass at night\n• Type: Cormorant Garamond for Scripture and headings, Figtree for the interface\n• Day accent: deep green. Night accent: gold","fill":"gray","size":"m"},"levels":{"x":1410,"y":3900,"w":420,"text":"The six levels, each with a photo of the real stone:\n1 Carnelian: words in order\n2 Topaz: fill the blanks\n3 Sapphire: whole text from its cue\n4 Emerald: both ways, even from a vague cue\n5 Amethyst: perfect for 3+ months\n6 Jasper: plus meaning and connected verses\n(No sapphire photo yet: the badge uses a color only.)","fill":"blue","size":"m"},"credits":{"x":1880,"y":3900,"w":420,"text":"Photos: Wikimedia Commons contributors under CC BY / CC BY-SA, credited on the mood board page. Each must be credited in the app or replaced with owned photography before launch.","fill":"gray","size":"s"}},"designSystems":[]}
